#: src/calls.rs:26
msgid "Luxafor call detection"
msgstr "Luxafor — détection d’appel"

#: src/calls.rs:234
msgid "callwatch.conf is no longer read: set the call status and the watched apps in Luxafor Panel → Settings (call-status, call-apps in statuses.conf)"
msgstr "callwatch.conf n’est plus lu : réglez le statut d’appel et les applications surveillées dans Luxafor Panel → Réglages (call-status, call-apps dans statuses.conf)"

#: src/calls.rs:240
msgid "pactl not found — install it with: sudo apt install pulseaudio-utils"
msgstr "pactl introuvable — installez-le avec : sudo apt install pulseaudio-utils"

